<!--
    Phase 1G: Manufacturing Schema Separation — Seed Data

    This file configures the entity group for manufacturing-owned entities,
    preparing them for migration to a dedicated manufacturing datasource.

    When a separate manufacturing datasource is configured in entityengine.xml,
    these entities will be automatically directed to the manufacturing schema
    via OFBiz's entity group mechanism.

    Manufacturing-owned entities:
    - TechDataCalendar, TechDataCalendarWeek, TechDataCalendarExcDay, TechDataCalendarExcWeek
    - MrpEvent, MrpEventType
    - ProductManufacturingRule

    See also: applications/manufacturing/entitydef/entitygroup.xml
-->

